  "outstanding": [
    "The adelic mean that equates the product of local densities to a global orbital average enters from OVM-03. The full-rank good-place calculation in GWD treats odd residue characteristic; HUD-01 derives the one-vector digit calculation without that restriction.",
    "The unit mean supplies the Hermitian denominator of short-flag probabilities. The dimension lower bound separately requires diagonal and mixed Gram estimates for normalized period maps."
  ]
